{"id":"tolpa","lemma":"толпа","pos":"noun","rank":2030,"glosses":["crowd, throng"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/49/Ru-%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BF%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BF%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"толпы","plural":"толпы"},"examples":[{"text":"Сегодня опять толпа.","en":"It's crowded again today.","words":[{"g":"today"},{"g":"again"},null]},{"text":"Везде будут толпы.","en":"It'll be crowded everywhere.","words":[{"g":"everywhere"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Там была большая толпа.","en":"There was a large crowd there.","words":[{"g":"there"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"big, large, great","l":"большой"},null]},{"text":"Я нашёл её среди толпы.","en":"I caught sight of her in the crowd.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/655399","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to find","l":"найти"},{"g":"her"},{"g":"among, in the midst of"},null]},{"text":"Вокруг него собиралась толпа.","en":"A crowd was gathering around him.","words":[{"g":"round, around, about"},{"g":"he, it","l":"он"},{"g":"to gather, to assemble","l":"собираться"},null]}]}